<title>USA: Mesa Air Group load factor rises in October.</title>
<headline>Mesa Air Group load factor rises in October.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		1995</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  56.8		54.3</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	   114,217	   117,588</p>
<p> Available seat miles		200,969	   216,606</p>
<p>					    Year-to-date</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  56.5		51.8</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	 1,135,998	 1,032,252</p>
<p> Available seat miles	    2,009,214	 1,994,223</p>
<p>(Revenue passenger and available seat miles in 000,000s)</p>
<p>NOTES: Year-to-date same as one month.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
